OL,3,GNEWSASuspected deadly bacteria outbreak
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council has said it is
OL,7,Finvestigating a suspected botulism
OL,8,Foutbreak in a man-made park lake.
OL,10,FPeople have reported seeing birds and
OL,11,Fother wildlife dead or unwell in St
OL,12,FGeorge Park in Bristol, and have been
OL,13,Furging Bristol City Council to take
OL,14,Faction.
OL,16,FVolunteers from Bath Swan Rescue have
OL,17,Fbeen trying to care for some of the
OL,18,Faffected animals and confirmed that two
OL,19,Fof the birds it picked up did have
OL,20,Fbotulism, a poison created by bacteria
OL,21,Fwhich thrives in shallow stagnant water
OL,22,Fin warm weather.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
